00:58:41.590 --> 00:58:46.750
<v Erin Einhold>I carried the child on my own back from the border while escaping from Dombrowa to Miejov.
<v Erin Einhold>我背着孩子从边境逃离，从栋布罗瓦逃到梅约夫。

00:58:46.750 --> 00:58:55.510
